# Little Wonder art masters — ~80 MB of source PNGs (single files up to
# 17 MB). Keep them locally / in cloud storage; only the optimised webp
# exports in projects/little-wonder/ (~790 KB total) are imported by
# content.js and shipped. See scripts/export-little-wonder-web.py.
src/assets/_source/projects/little-wonder/**/*.png
src/assets/_source/projects/little-wonder/**/*.jpeg
